      "id": 1,
      "text": "Fulham's first aircraft workshop was run by aviation pioneer Geoffrey de Havilland in the early 20th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulham",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Lillie Langtry pub, originally the Lillie Arms, dates back to 1835 and was part of the North End Brewery complex.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulham",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fulham's tube stations include Putney Bridge, Parsons Green, Fulham Broadway, West Kensington, and Baron's Court, serving both Wimbledon and Richmond lines.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulham",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area once hosted the North End Brewery, Cannons, and Kops Brewery, reflecting Fulham's 19th‑century brewing heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulham",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Fulham's industrial past featured pottery, tapestry‑weaving, and paper‑making on High Street, later giving way to automotive and aviation industries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulham",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Art Bronze Foundry, founded in 1922 on Michael Road, operated until 2017 before redevelopment into apartments.",
